<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:
minor-latin">Hi <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;Name&gt;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal">Leaders in the <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;Black&gt;</span>
community play an important role in helping the American Red Cross fulfill our
lifesaving mission. As a leader in your community, I wanted to reach out to you
today to invite you to join our lifesaving efforts to host a Red Cross blood
drive in January in honor of the upcoming Dr. Martin Luther King Jr.
Holiday.&nbsp;&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">My name is </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background: yellow;">&lt;Name&gt;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;"> and I am an American Red Cross &lt;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background: yellow;">Account Manager, Sickle Cell
Account Manager, Area Booking Manager</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&gt;.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">The holiday is not only a time for honoring Dr. King’s
achievements but also for promoting community service and activism. Many
schools, churches, and organizations like yours are already involved in
activities and community projects during this time, and incorporating a blood
drive is another awesome way to commemorate his legacy by bringing the
community together in the spirit of compassion, diversity, and unity.&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">The American Red Cross is also committed to compassion,
diversity, and unity, and encourages eligible donors of all races and
ethnicities to give blood to increase the diversity of the blood supply. One
way we are promoting diversity is by teaming up with partners in the Black
community to grow the number of blood donors who are Black because 1 in 3
African American blood donors are a match for people with sickle cell disease.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Let’s find time to talk so I can introduce myself and talk
about hosting a Red Cross</span><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><i> “MLK Day: A Day On, Not a Day Off Blood Drive”
in January </i></b><span style="font-size: 12pt;">with your organization.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Sincerely,</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal">











</p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;AM/SAM/ABM
Name&gt;</span><o:p></o:p></p><b><i></i></b><p></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[]]></td>
